  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A variable force with a maximum F<sub>max</sub> is applied to an object over a time interval T. The object has a mass m and is initially at rest.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the speed of the object at time T?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F_{max}T}{2m}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F_{max}T}{m}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\">F<sub>max</sub>Tm</li><li data-label=\"D\">2F<sub>max</sub>Tm</li></ol>"
  },
